// Team ID placeholder.
//
// After Apple approves the Developer Program enrolment, set your Team ID here.
// Apple Developer → Membership details → Team ID. It is 10 characters, for example AB12CD34EF.
// That example is only the shape. Do not invent a Team ID, and do not paste a certificate,
// a provisioning profile, or an App Store Connect .p8 key into this repository.
//
// You can also set the Team in Xcode: target KERNL → Signing & Capabilities → Team.
// Xcode writes the same DEVELOPMENT_TEAM value. Leave the line empty until you have it.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Apple Development
